WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.160
I can’t be beside Mum every minute.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.480
But a forgotten detail shouldn’t have to
become a whole lost afternoon.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:07.820
Threadline.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:09.340
A little context.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.640
A little closer.
